<style>
  @page {
    size: A4;
    margin: 0;
  }
  .page {
    width: 794px;
    height: 1123px;
    padding: 50px 60px;
    box-sizing: border-box;
    overflow: hidden;
    page-break-after: always;
    position: relative;
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial, "DejaVu Sans", "Liberation Sans";
  }
  .page:last-child {
    page-break-after: auto;
  }
  h1, h2, h3 {
    font-family: "DejaVu Serif", "Liberation Serif", Georgia, "Helvetica", Arial;
    font-weight: bold;
  }
  .section-title {
    font-size: 24pt;
    margin-bottom: 20px;
  }
  .subtitle {
    font-size: 14pt;
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  .content-block {
    margin-bottom: 30px;
  }
  ul {
    list-style-type: disc;
    margin-left: 20px;
    padding-left: 0;
  }
  li {
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .two-column {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    gap: 40px;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .column {
    flex: 1;
  }
  .image-container {
    text-align: center;
    margin-top: 20px;
  }
  .image-container img {
    max-width: 100%;
    height: auto;
  }
  .caption {
    font-size: 10pt;
    margin-top: 5px;
  }
  .diagram-container {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-around;
    align-items: center;
    margin-top: 40px;
    padding: 20px 0;
  }
  .diagram-step {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .icon {
    font-size: 40pt;
    margin-bottom: 10px;
  }
  .grid-layout {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr);
    gap: 30px;
    margin-top: 30px;
  }
  .map-container {
    text-align: center;
  }
  .legend {
    margin-top: 20px;
    font-size: 10pt;
  }
</style>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <div style="width: 30%;">
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #8BC34A; border-radius: 50%; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #2196F3; border-radius: 50%; margin-bottom: 10px;"></div>
      <div style="width: 150px; height: 150px; background-color: #FF9800; border-radius: 50%;"></div>
    </div>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 36pt; margin: 0;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>
  <div style="text-align: center; margin-bottom: 50px;">
    <h1 style="font-size: 32pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">Community Solar and Grid</h1>
    <h1 style="font-size: 32pt; margin-top: 0;">Value of DERs</h1>
    <p style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 30px;">{{ executive_director_name }}, Executive Director</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">Who is CCSA?</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">WHO</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">National coalition of businesses and non-profits working to expand customer choice and access to solar for all American households and businesses through community solar.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">MISSION</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Empower every American energy consumer with the option to choose local, clean, and affordable community solar.</p>
  </div>

  <div class="content-block">
    <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 10px;">WHAT</h3>
    <p style="font-size: 12pt;">We work with customers, utilities, local stakeholders, and policymakers to develop and implement policies and best practices that ensure community solar programs provide a win, win, win for all, starting with the customer.</p>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">What is Community Solar?</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <ul style="font-size: 12pt;">
    <li>Locally-sited solar arrays shared by individual community members, who receive credits on their electricity bills for their portion of power produced.</li>
    <li>Projects typically 2-5 MW and connected to the distribution system.</li>
    <li>Homeowners, renters, businesses, schools, hospitals, towns and more receive the energy output from a single solar array.</li>
  </ul>

  <div class="image-container">
    <img src="placeholder_solar_diagram.png" alt="Community Solar Diagram" style="max-width: 80%;">
    <div class="caption">Diagram illustrating community solar energy flow.</div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">What Does Community Solar Look Like?</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="grid-layout">
    <div class="column">
      <div class="image-container">
        <img src="placeholder_solar_field_1.png" alt="Solar Field Example 1" style="max-width: 100%;">
        <div class="caption">
          {{ location_1_name }}<br>
          {{ location_1_state }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column">
      <div class="image-container">
        <img src="placeholder_solar_field_2.png" alt="Solar Field Example 2" style="max-width: 100%;">
        <div class="caption">
          {{ location_2_name }}<br>
          {{ location_2_state }}
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">How Does Community Solar Work?</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="diagram-container">
    <div class="diagram-step">
      <div class="icon">&#9998;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Community Solar Developer</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Project Development & Maintenance</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram-step">
      <div class="icon">&#9728;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Community Solar Project</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Electricity Produced</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram-step">
      <div class="icon">&#9889;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Electric Utility</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Community Solar Bill Credits</p>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-around; margin-top: 60px;">
    <div class="diagram-step" style="text-align: left;">
      <div class="icon">&#127968;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Community Solar Developer</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Upfront or Ongoing Participation Payment</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram-step" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="icon">&#127968;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Community Solar Subscribers</p>
    </div>
    <div class="diagram-step" style="text-align: right;">
      <div class="icon">&#9889;</div>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Electric Utility</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt;">Community Solar Bill Credits</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">Sample Community Solar Bill</h2>

  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; margin-top: 30px;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Subscription Model:</h3>
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Ongoing Monthly Payments</p>
        <ul style="list-style: none; padding-left: 0; margin-top: 10px;">
          <li style="font-size: 12pt;">Electricity: <span data-field="bill_electricity_rate">{{ bill_electricity_rate }}</span> x <span data-field="bill_electricity_usage">{{ bill_electricity_usage }}</span></li>
          <li style="font-size: 12pt;">Solar Credit: <span data-field="bill_solar_credit_rate">{{ bill_solar_credit_rate }}</span> x <span data-field="bill_solar_credit_usage">{{ bill_solar_credit_usage }}</span></li>
        </ul>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">
          <span>TOTAL:</span>
          <span><span data-field="bill_total">{{ bill_total }}</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div style="width: 50%;">
      <div style="border: 1px solid #ccc; padding: 15px;">
        <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Community Solar Subscription Bill to System Owner</h3>
        <div style="margin-bottom: 20px;">
          <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Monthly Subscription Payment: <span data-field="subscription_payment">{{ subscription_payment }}</span></p>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 20px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">
          <span>Total savings per month:</span>
          <span><span data-field="savings_monthly">{{ savings_monthly }}</span></span>
        </div>
        <div style="margin-top: 10px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; font-size: 14pt; font-weight: bold;">
          <span>Savings over 20 years:</span>
          <span><span data-field="savings_20_years">{{ savings_20_years }}</span></span>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div style="margin-top: 50px; display: flex; justify-content: space-around;">
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Utility Bill Example</h3>
      <img src="placeholder_utility_bill.png" alt="Utility Bill" style="max-width: 100%;">
    </div>
    <div style="width: 45%;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-bottom: 15px;">Subscription Bill Example</h3>
      <img src="placeholder_subscription_bill.png" alt="Subscription Bill" style="max-width: 100%;">
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">Why Community Solar?</h2>

  <div class="grid-layout">
    <div class="column" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="icon" style="color: #333;">&#128274;</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">Promotes Access and Competition</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">All customers can participate regardless of their economic status or housing type and allows for different business models to meet different needs.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="column" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="icon" style="color: #333;">&#36;</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">Offers Subscriber Savings and Flexibility</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Customers save 10-15% per month with many states targeting savings toward LMI participants. Flexible subscriptions that are pay-as-you-go, portable, and scalable up to 120% of annual electricity usage.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="column" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="icon" style="color: #333;">&#9925;</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">Good for the Grid</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Third-party financing of renewable energy, improves grid reliability, centrally planned, economies of scale, and distribution benefits of DERs = good for customers and utilities.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="column" style="text-align: center;">
      <div class="icon" style="color: #333;">&#127022;</div>
      <h3 style="font-size: 16pt; margin-top: 10px;">Benefits the Local Economy and Farmers</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 12pt;">Diversifies local economy, creates local jobs (~50-100/project), increases property tax revenue for local jurisdictions, and offers stable lease revenue for farmers and landowners while still preserving farmland.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<div class="page">
  <div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
    <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size: 24pt;">Third-party Community Solar Legislation in 22 States</h2>
    <div style="text-align: right;">
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">COALITION FOR COMMUNITY</h1>
      <h1 style="font-size: 24pt;">SOLAR ACCESS</h1>
    </div>
  </div>

  <div class="two-column">
    <div class="column map-container">
      <img src="placeholder_us_map.png" alt="US Map showing solar legislation" style="max-width: 100%;">
      <div class="legend">
        <span style="color: blue;">&#9679; Established program</span> |
        <span style="color: red;">&#9679; Rules in place but limited market</span> |
        <span style="color: green;">&#9679; Legislation proposed or pending</span> |
        <span style="color: orange;">&#9679; Legislation in place, regulations pending</span>
      </div>
    </div>
    <div class="column" style="text-align: left;">
      <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-bottom: 20px;">Total installed capacity, 2021:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">3+ Gigawatts</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">~1,500 Projects</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Total potential capacity, 2030:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">50+ Gigawatts</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">15,000+ Projects</p>

      <h3 style="font-size: 18pt; margin-top: 30px; margin-bottom: 20px;">Total customers served:</h3>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">2021: ~100-200,000</p>
      <p style="font-size: 14pt;">2030: 5 million+</p>
      <p style="font-size: 10pt; margin-top: 40px;">Source: CCSA and NREL datasets; Vibrant Clean Energy "Local Solar Roadmap" 2020.</p>
    </div>
  </div>
</div>

<style>
